      "text": "Transfer from hotel to the Airport. Fly to Iguazu via Buenos Aires. Arrival at Puerto Iguazú, transfer from Airport to the hotel.\n\nAfter the cold of Patagonia, the climate changes completely. Iguazu lies in humid subtropical forest. In a single journey, the glacier and cold air give way to heat, dense greenery and spray rising above the cascades. That contrast shapes the second half of the trip.",
